# Loot, Exuberant Explorer: "You may play an additional land on each of your turns" (CR 305.2). Bot1 plays two Forests in its turn
# and is refused a third; Bot2, whose lands the Explorer does not help, is refused a second Island on its own turn, and then plays
# its one land per turn only.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Loot, Exuberant Explorer
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
